# Derived cache of seed_schemes.json, regenerated by data.ingestion.scrape.
# Tracking it meant the cache shadowed the source of truth: scrape.py returns
# the cache whenever it exists, so an edit to seed_schemes.json had no effect
# for anyone who already had the file. A fresh clone falls back to the seed
# and rewrites the cache, which is the behaviour that was wanted all along.
data/ingestion/raw_data/myscheme_pilot.json
